# ESP32 Learning Collection

This repository is a collection of my ESP32 learning projects during my early development phase.

Each branch is treated as a separate project or experiment, so I can keep ideas isolated while I learn and iterate.

Development is done with PlatformIO in Visual Studio Code.

## Notes

- Main sketches live in `src/`
- Additional experiments may appear in separate branches
- The project is organized for hands-on learning and testing
